#: .\core\views.py:261
msgid ""
"Manage service types, availability, and order flow in one place without "
"switching tools."
msgstr "Gérez types de service, disponibilité et flux de commandes au même endroit, sans changer d'outil."

#: .\core\views.py:264
msgid "One dashboard for all channels"
